This is the only YAML for creating an owner. The flow is a linear chain: `validate` → `build` → `save` → `respond`. It requires role `OWNER_ADMIN`, and the build/save/respond steps run under a `transaction` governance.

Note: `ApplyOwner.java` exists in the same package but is NOT referenced by this POST YAML (it is used by the PUT/update flow — `owners/{ownerId}.PUT.yml`).

